====================================================================

This repository ("Theologia Caerulea · 蓝色神学档案馆") contains derivative and
reference works based on entries from the SCP Foundation Wiki (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/
and https://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/), alongside public-domain Cthulhu Mythos /
Hermetic references and original ("原创") lore and source code.

In accordance with the SCP Foundation licensing policy, all SCP-derived text and
composite worldbuilding in this project are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Referenced SCP Canon Works & Original Authors:
- SCP-001 (Dr. Clef's Proposal: "The Gate Guardian") — by DrClef (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-clef-s-proposal)
- SCP-610 ("The Flesh that Hates") — by NekoChris (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-610)
- SCP-1730 ("What Happened to Site-13?") — by djkaktus (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-1730)
- SCP-2000 ("Deus Ex Machina") — by HammerMaiden (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2000)
- SCP-2264 ("In the Court of Alagadda") — by Metaphysician (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2264)
- SCP-2317 ("A Door to Another World") — by DrClef (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2317)
- SCP-2662 ("cthulhu f'UCK OFF!") — by SoullessSingularity (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2662)
- SCP-3000 ("Anantashesha") — by djkaktus, Joreth, and A Random Day (https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3000)
- Church of the Broken God / Mekhane & Sarkicism — SCP Wiki Collaborative Canon

Original Extensions ("原创设定"):
- "Theologia Caerulea / 赫尔墨斯蓝色神学" cross-canon synthesis, Site-01 Alexandria Pharos
  setting, Site-CN-01 Penglai synthesis, and interactive visualization source code are
  original works created for this archive and released under CC BY-SA 3.0.
